# The X11 programs load fontconfig through Xft.  Fontconfig never frees its
# configuration, so every run reports a small fixed leak that is not ours.
# That report makes the programs exit with an error status, which the X11
# smoke tests treat as a failure.  Leaks in our own code are still reported.
leak:libfontconfig
